/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 166 0 R
/T (The Vendor Posted Payment Journal in Microsoft Dynamics 365 shows all vendor payments that have already been posted in the system. It includes details such as the vendor account, payment date, voucher number, payment amount, and currency. This report helps track completed vendor payments and shows how each payment is applied to specific invoices. It also displays the original invoice amount, the payment made, and the remaining balance, providing a clear record of vendor payment transactions.)
/E (The Vendor Posted Payment Journal in Microsoft Dynamics 365 shows all vendor payments that have already been posted in the system. It includes details such as the vendor account, payment date, voucher number, payment amount, and currency. This report helps track completed vendor payments and shows how each payment is applied to specific invoices. It also displays the original invoice amount, the payment made, and the remaining balance, providing a clear record of vendor payment transactions.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
